## 0. What to execute, and in what order

| Step | Action |
|---|---|
| 1 | **Back up first.** Supabase → Database → Backups. RLS changes are not data changes, but a backup is the only way to undo a mistake. |
| 2 | Run `docs/supabase-schema.sql` in the SQL editor. It is safe to re-run and touches no data. |
